{"results":[{"url":"https://bhoomi-airavat.com","title":"Bhoomi Airavat Borivali West - Elite Class 2 & 3 BHK Homes","raw_content":" [Skip to content](#content)\n\n[![Bhoomi Airavat Logo](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/bhoomi-airavat-logo.webp \"Bhoomi Airavat Logo\")](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/)\n\n# Bhoomi Airavat Borivali West\n\nAchieving a perfect blend of architectural brilliance and soulful living, Bhoomi Airavat in Borivali West at Mumbai by Bhoomi Group represents a definitive paradigm shift in urban elegance.\n\nThese prestigious residential dwellings at Bhoomi Airavat Borivali West on Sai Baba Mandir Road feature fine-tuned apartments designed specifically for the requirements of Mumbai’s elite home seekers.\n\nBhoomi Airavat Borivali stands as a beacon of sophisticated housing developed by Bhoomi Realty, offering vastu-compliant layouts and modern aesthetics within this highly vibrant, growing neighborhood.\n\nThe under-construction skyscraper at Bhoomi Airavat Mumbai on Sai Baba Mandir Marg ensures legal transparency and premium specifications, redefining the standard for luxury suburban apartments today.\n\n##### **Project**\n\nBhoomi Airavat\n\n##### Developer\n\nBhoomi Shashwat Estate\n\n##### Location\n\nBorivali West\n\n##### [RERA](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/)\n\n##### Launch Date\n\nMay 2026\n\n##### Current Status\n\nUnder Construction\n\n##### Possession\n\nDecember 2031\n\n##### Typology\n\n2 & 3 BHK\n\n##### Towers\n\n3\n\n##### Floors\n\n39\n\n##### Total Units\n\n460\n\n##### Land Parcel\n\n9.9 Acres\n\n#### Config.\n\n#### Carpet Area\n\n#### Price\n\n2 BHK\n\n778 SqFt.\n\n₹ 2.49 Cr.\n\n3 BHK\n\n1184 SqFt.\n\n₹ 3.79 Cr.\n\nEnquire\n\nContact Bhoomi Airavat on +91 9975970295 for an exclusive site visit, confirmed appointment, latest price list, and detailed floor plans. Reach out to our sales office to receive the project brochure, sample flat videos, live location coordinates, and a personalized virtual tour. We provide comprehensive assistance regarding the cost sheet, flexible payment plans, final quotes, verified reviews, and the most recent construction status updates.\n\n[Digital Brochure](#)\n\n## Visual Journey Of Bhoomi Airavat\n\nTake a virtual walkthrough of Bhoomi Airavat, highlighting the contemporary elevation and the elite living concept. These visuals offer a deep dive into the construction status and the high-end lifestyle awaiting you in this premier development.\n\n[![Bhoomi Airavat Video 1](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/bhoomi-airavat-video-thumbnail-1.webp \"Bhoomi Airavat Video 1\")](https://www.youtube.com/@salesteam)\n\n[![Bhoomi Airavat Video 2](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/bhoomi-airavat-video-thumbnail-2.webp \"Bhoomi Airavat Video 2\")](https://www.youtube.com/@salesteam)\n\n[![Bhoomi Airavat Video 3](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/bhoomi-airavat-video-thumbnail-3.webp \"Bhoomi Airavat Video 3\")](https://www.youtube.com/@salesteam)\n\n[Schedule Appointment](#)\n\n## World-Class Indulgences & Elite Lifestyle Amenities\n\nThis premier development **[features](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/blogs/top-modern-apartment-amenities-in-borivali-west)** multiple levels of leisure, from ground-floor social hubs to upper-tier fitness zones, ensuring that wellness remains just a few steps from your foyer. These facilities are crafted to blend relaxation with modern activity, creating a private sanctuary in the heart of the city at Bhoomi Airavat.\n\n![Airavat Borivali Clubhouse](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/airavat-borivali-clubhouse-01.webp \"Airavat Borivali Clubhouse\")\n\n### The Signature Club\n\n* **Private Cinema:** A bespoke mini theatre tailored for exclusive movie screenings and live sports events in an intimate, high-definition setting.\n* **Grand Banquet Hall:** A sophisticated venue designed for hosting memorable social gatherings, high-profile celebrations, and community events.\n* **Assembly Kitchen:** A fully equipped culinary space to support seamless catering and gourmet preparation for your private functions.\n* **Professional Business Center:** A quiet, modern workspace featuring dedicated work pods and high-speed connectivity for maximum productivity.\n\n![Airavat Borivali Games Zone](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/airavat-borivali-games-zone-02.webp \"Airavat Borivali Games Zone\")\n\n### The Wellness & Sports Hub\n\n* **Premier Fitness Studio:** A sprawling gymnasium featuring state-of-the-art cardio equipment and a specialized kickboxing setup for high-intensity training.\n* **Professional Badminton Courts:** High-standard indoor courts designed for both casual family play and competitive athletic matches.\n* **Indoor Games Zone:** An engaging arena for recreation, featuring a variety of tabletop and skill-based games like pool, chess, and table tennis.\n* **Locker & Washroom Suite:** Well-appointed, hygienic common washrooms with secure locker facilities for the convenience of active residents.\n\n![Airavat Borivali Rooftop](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/airavat-borivali-rooftop-03.webp \"Airavat Borivali Rooftop\")\n\n### The Rooftop Sky-Lounge & Retreat\n\n* **Zen Meditation Deck:** A peaceful, open-air space designed for morning yoga and mindfulness, offering panoramic views of the Borivali skyline.\n* **Star-Gazing Gallery:** A dedicated observation point equipped with seating to enjoy the night sky away from the city’s immediate bustle.\n* **Sky Barbeque Pit:** An outdoor culinary station perfect for weekend grill-outs and alfresco dining under the stars with friends.\n* **Reflexology Pathway:** A beautifully landscaped walking track designed to stimulate pressure points and improve blood circulation while you stroll.\n\n![Airavat Borivali Kids Zone](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/airavat-borivali-kids-zone-04.webp \"Airavat Borivali Kids Zone\")\n\n### The Kids’ Growth & Adventure Zone\n\n* **Toddlers’ Play Cove:** A safely cushioned, vibrant indoor play area designed specifically for the sensory development of younger children.\n* **Multi-Purpose Sand Pit:** A classic outdoor play feature that encourages tactile learning and creative play in a secure environment.\n* **Youth Hobby Room:** A creative space for music, arts, and crafts, allowing the younger generation to explore their talents within the safety of the complex.\n* **Interactive Library:** A quiet reading corner stocked with a diverse collection of books to foster a habit of learning and curiosity.\n\n[Book Site Visit](#)\n\n## Infrastructure Advancements Near Bhoomi Airavat Borivali\n\nBhoomi Airavat Borivali sits at the epicenter of a massive urban transformation featuring high-speed transit corridors and strategic engineering marvels. These upcoming developments are set to slash travel times, significantly boosting local property values and ensuring a prosperous future for smart investors.\n\n### Advanced Rapid Transit Networks:\n\n* **Metro Line 2A (Dahisar-Andheri West):** This operational route serves as a primary link between major residential clusters and the commercial hubs of the western suburbs.\n* **Metro Line 7 (Dahisar East-Andheri East):** A vital development creating a robust north-to-south connection, integrating the Borivali region with the international airport and business districts.\n* **Coastal Road Extension:** A high-speed transit route designed to streamline traffic and improve accessibility, directly connecting the northern suburbs to South Mumbai.\n\n### Regional Roadways & Engineering Milestones:\n\n* **Borivali-Thane Twin Tunnel:** A ground-breaking project through the lush Sanjay Gandhi National Park that will drastically reduce the cross-city commute between the east and west.\n* **Western Express Highway Enhancements:** This major transit artery is being upgraded to support smoother vehicular flow and faster connectivity to the city’s southern core.\n* **SV Road & Link Road Modernization:** Ongoing improvements to these parallel roads ensure seamless access to nearby schools, hospitals, and premium shopping malls.\n\n[Sample Flat Video](#)\n\n## Centrality & Unmatched Accessibility\n\nResiding at Bhoomi Airavat places you at the epicenter of Borivali’s most established urban intersection, offering a lifestyle where convenience and luxury meet. Residents thrive in a self-sufficient ecosystem where premium commercial hubs and high-speed transit coexist in perfect harmony with the lush greenery of the nearby national park.\n\n![Airavat Borivali Shopping](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/airavat-borivali-shopping-icon-07.svg \"Airavat Borivali Shopping\")\n\n### Premier Shopping Destinations\n\n* **Moksh Plaza Mall**\n* **Indraprastha Shopping Complex**\n* **Reliance Mall**\n* **The Zone Mall**\n* **Raghuleela Mega Mall**\n* **D Mart (Shimpoli Road)**\n\n![Airavat Borivali Business Hub](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/airavat-borivali-business-hub-icon-08.svg \"Airavat Borivali Business Hub\")\n\n## Corporate & Business Hubs\n\n* **Mindspace Malad (IT Hub)**\n* **Nirlon Knowledge Park**\n* **Nesco IT Park**\n* **Infinity IT Park**\n* **Lotus Corporate Park**\n\n![Airavat Borivali Nature](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/airavat-borivali-nature-icon-09.svg \"Airavat Borivali Nature\")\n\n## Ecological & Leisure Retreats\n\n* **Sanjay Gandhi National Park**\n* **Gorai Beach & Pagoda**\n* **Vazira Naka Gardens**\n* **Mandpeshwar Caves**\n* **Jhula Maidan**\n* **Water Kingdom & EsselWorld**\n\n![Airavat Borivali Education](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/airavat-borivali-education-icon-10.svg \"Airavat Borivali Education\")\n\n## Elite Academic Institutions\n\n* **Don Bosco High School**\n* **St. Francis D’Assisi High School**\n* **Swami Vivekanand International School**\n* **Orchids The International School**\n* **St. Lawrence High School**\n\n![Airavat Borivali Healthcare](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/airavat-borivali-healthcare-icon-11.svg \"Airavat Borivali Healthcare\")\n\n## Leading Healthcare Centers\n\n* **Karuna Hospital**\n* **Apex Multispeciality Hospital**\n* **Lotus Multispeciality Hospital**\n* **HCG Cancer Centre**\n* **Navneet Hi-Tech Hospital**\n\n![Airavat Borivali Airport](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/airavat-borivali-healthcare-icon-12.svg \"Airavat Borivali Airport\")\n\n## Airports & Major Expresswayset\n\n* **Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport**\n* **Western Express Highway (WEH)**\n* **Mumbai Coastal Road Extension**\n* **New Link Road**\n* **National Highway 48 (NH-48)**\n\n[Live Location](#)\n\n[Home Pick & Drop](#)\n\n![Airavat Borivali 2 BHK Floor Plan](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/airavat-borivali-2-bhk-floor-plan.webp \"Airavat Borivali 2 BHK Floor Plan\")\n\n![Airavat Borivali 3 BHK Floor Plan](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/airavat-borivali-3-bhk-floor-plan.webp \"Airavat Borivali 3 BHK Floor Plan\")\n\n![Airavat Borivali Master Bedroom Floor Plan](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/airavat-borivali-master-bedroom-floor-plan.webp \"Airavat Borivali Master Bedroom Floor Plan\")\n\n![Airavat Borivali Parking Floor Plan](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/airavat-borivali-parking-floor-plan.webp \"Airavat Borivali Parking Floor Plan\")\n\n## Elite Floor Plans At Bhoomi Airavat\n\nThe high-rise silhouette of Bhoomi Airavat stands as a testament to modern engineering, offering **[expansive 2 and 3 BHK layouts](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/blogs/2-bhk-vs-3-bhk-apartments-in-borivali-west)** that prioritize carpet area efficiency. Every residence is crafted with a private transition foyer and a dedicated dining alcove, ensuring a natural movement between the sun-drenched living zones and the quiet, tranquil bedrooms designed for optimal rest.\n\n## Investment Potential & Future Growth In Borivali West\n\nAllocating capital in this premium residential pocket secures a high-yield asset within the rapidly evolving Western Suburbs. Accelerated by transformative infrastructure like the upcoming coastal road and twin tunnel projects, property values here are poised to outpace standard market appreciation, delivering substantial long-term returns for homeowners.\n\n![Bhumi Airavat Borivali West Investment](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/bhumi-airavat-borivali-west-investment-image-01.webp \"Bhumi Airavat Borivali West Investment\")\n\n### Strategic Wealth Creation & Market Upside:\n\n* **Infrastructure Dominance:** Proximity to the operational Metro Line 2A and 7 ensures a significant surge in future valuation as commuting becomes even more seamless.\n* **Proximity to Business Districts:** Ideally situated with easy access to Mindspace Malad and Nirlon Knowledge Park, attracting premium tenants for superior rental yields.\n* **Transit Advantage:** The proposed Borivali-Thane subterranean tunnel will drastically reduce travel time to the central suburbs, making this a high-demand residential destination.\n* **Neighborhood Maturation:** As the area transitions from a traditional suburb to a luxury housing hub, early movers stand to gain massive equity growth.\n\n![Bhumi Airavat Mumbai Trust Legacy](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/bhumi-airavat-mumbai-trust-legacy-image-02.webp \"Bhumi Airavat Mumbai Trust Legacy\")\n\n### Verified Developer Trust & Quality Standards:\n\n* **Corporate Pedigree:** Invest with confidence in a brand celebrated for delivering over 50 successful projects and housing more than 12,000 happy families across Mumbai.\n* **MahaRERA Transparency:** This legally sound project guarantees complete regulatory and architectural clarity, safeguarding your financial interests.\n* **Premium Living Dividend:** The **[exclusive residential design](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/blogs/5-reasons-family-friendly-apartments-in-borivali-west)** offers an elite lifestyle and privacy-focused ecosystem that generic mass-market developments cannot match.\n* **Commitment to Excellence:** Benefit from a proven track record of structural brilliance and a steadfast focus on creating landmark residential addresses.\n\n[Cost Sheet](#)\n\n## A Preview Of Refined Living\n\nExplore the latest renders and site photos showcasing the premium interiors, well-ventilated residences, and the expansive lifestyle amenity zones. The gallery provides a transparent view of the rapid development progress of this iconic tower in Borivali West.\n\n[![Airavat Borivali West Elevators](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/airavat-borivali-west-elevators-05.webp \"Airavat Borivali West Elevators\")](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/airavat-borivali-west-elevators-05.webp)\n\n![Bhoomi Airavat Borivali West Parking](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/bhoomi-airavat-borivali-west-parking-02.webp \"Bhoomi Airavat Borivali West Parking\")\n\n[![Bhoomi Airavat Borivali West Security](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/bhoomi-airavat-borivali-west-security-01.webp \"Bhoomi Airavat Borivali West Security\")](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/bhoomi-airavat-borivali-west-security-01.webp)\n\n[![Bhoomi Airavat Borivali West CCTV Surveillance](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/bhoomi-airavat-borivali-west-cctv-surveillance-04.webp \"Bhoomi Airavat Borivali West CCTV Surveillance\")](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/bhoomi-airavat-borivali-west-cctv-surveillance-04.webp)\n\n[![Bhoomi Airavat Borivali West Broadwalk](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/bhoomi-airavat-borivali-west-aroma-broadwalk-03.webp \"Bhoomi Airavat Borivali West Broadwalk\")](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/bhoomi-airavat-borivali-west-aroma-broadwalk-03.webp)\n\n[![Airavat Borivali West Lobby](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/airavat-borivali-west-lobby-08.webp \"Airavat Borivali West Lobby\")](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/airavat-borivali-west-lobby-08.webp)\n\n[![Airavat Borivali West Gym](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/airavat-borivali-west-gym-07.webp \"Airavat Borivali West Gym\")](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/airavat-borivali-west-gym-07.webp)\n\n[![Airavat Borivali West Fire System](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/airavat-borivali-west-fire-system-06.webp \"Airavat Borivali West Fire System\")](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/airavat-borivali-west-fire-system-06.webp)\n\n[Final Quote](#)\n\n## Industry Trends & Blogs\n\nStay informed with our latest editorial pieces examining how enhanced transit networks are influencing valuation trends for Bhoomi Airavat. These comprehensive reports offer stakeholders data-backed construction milestones and deep-dive local area assessments to facilitate a well-informed real estate acquisition.\n\n[![Family-Friendly Apartments](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/bhumi-airavat-borivali-west-blog-1.webp \"Family-Friendly Apartments\")](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/blogs/5-reasons-family-friendly-apartments-in-borivali-west)\n\n### [5 Reasons Families Prefer Borivali West For Residential Living](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/blogs/5-reasons-family-friendly-apartments-in-borivali-west)\n\nJune 10, 2026\n\n[![Modern Apartment Amenities](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/bhumi-airavat-borivali-west-blog-2.webp \"Modern Apartment Amenities\")](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/blogs/top-modern-apartment-amenities-in-borivali-west)\n\n### [Top Amenities to Look for in Borivali West Apartments](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/blogs/top-modern-apartment-amenities-in-borivali-west)\n\nJune 10, 2026\n\n[![Borivali West Apartments](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/bhumi-airavat-borivali-west-blog-3.webp \"Borivali West Apartments\")](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/blogs/2-bhk-vs-3-bhk-apartments-in-borivali-west)\n\n### [2 BHK vs 3 BHK Apartments in Borivali West](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/blogs/2-bhk-vs-3-bhk-apartments-in-borivali-west)\n\nJune 10, 2026\n\n[View All](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/blogs)\n\n## FAQs\n\nQ.  What are the different apartment configurations available at the prestigious Bhoomi Airavat residential project?\n\nA:  The development primarily offers expansive two and three-bedroom luxury residences designed with modern architectural layouts.\n\nQ.  Where exactly is the prime site location for the upcoming Bhoomi Airavat Borivali West development?\n\nA:  This landmark tower is strategically situated on Sai Baba Mandir Road within the heart of Mumbai.\n\nQ.  Which reputed real estate firm is the main developer behind the iconic Bhoomi Group project?\n\nA:  The project is being meticulously crafted and delivered by the well-known and trusted Bhoomi Realty team.\n\nQ.  How can a prospective homebuyer obtain the official Bhoomi Airavat brochure for detailed project insights?\n\nA:  You can download the comprehensive digital guidebook by contacting our dedicated sales team at the provided number.\n\nQ.  What is the current construction status of the high-rise Bhoomi Airavat Mumbai residential tower?\n\nA:  The project is currently in the advanced stages of development with structural work progressing at a steady pace.\n\nQ.  How can I contact Bhoomi Airavat in Borivali West for site visits and bookings?\n\nA:  You can contact Bhoomi Airavat Borivali West directly on**[+91 9975970295](https://bhoomi-airavat.com/contact-us)**  to schedule a site visit, get the latest price details, request floor plans, or book an appointment. The sales team also provides assistance with brochures, cost sheets, and construction updates.\n\n[Payment Plan](#)\n\n× Enquire\n\n× Enquire\n\nScroll to Top\n\n ","images":[]},{"url":"https://housiey.com/projects/bhoomi-aer","title":"Bhoomi AER Borivali West - Brochure, Pros&Cons, PriceSheet","raw_content":"Bhoomi AER Borivali West - Brochure, Pros&Cons, PriceSheet\n\n[Home](/)\n[Mumbai](/in/mumbai)\n\n>\n\n[Borivali West](/in/mumbai/borivali-west)\n\nLast updated: Jul 22, 2026\n\n![Project image 1](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/bhoomi-aer_1769601189916-835323033-1280w.webp)![Project image 2](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/bhoomi-aer_1769601158435-763077006-1280w.webp)![Project image 3](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/bhoomi-aer_1769601159128-830061780-1280w.webp)![Project image 4](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/bhoomi-aer_1769601160542-788593277-1280w.webp)![Project image 5](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/bhoomi-aer_1769601161610-608631077-1280w.webp)![Project image 6](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/bhoomi-aer_1769601163417-691041456-1280w.webp)![Project image 7](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/bhoomi-aer_1769601164691-854820245-1280w.webp)![Project image 8](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/bhoomi-aer_1769601166374-708187923-1280w.webp)![Project image 9](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/bhoomi-aer_1769601167159-602359886-1280w.webp)\n\n# Bhoomi AER Borivali West\n\n[By Bhoomi Group](/builder/bhoomi-group)|\n\nSai Baba Nagar, [Borivali West](/in/mumbai/borivali-west)\n\n₹5.25 Cr - 10.49 Cr All inc.\n\n![Bhoomi AER Borivali West - main project image](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/bhoomi-aer_1769601189916-835323033-1280w.webp)\n\n![Bhoomi AER Borivali West - image 2](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/bhoomi-aer_1769601158435-763077006-1280w.webp)\n\n![Bhoomi AER Borivali West - image 3](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/bhoomi-aer_1769601159128-830061780-1280w.webp)\n\n![Bhoomi AER Borivali West - image 4](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/bhoomi-aer_1769601160542-788593277-1280w.webp)\n\n![Bhoomi AER Borivali West - image 5](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/bhoomi-aer_1769601161610-608631077-1280w.webp)\n\n4+ more\n\nWatch This Project Reel\n\nSee highlights of Bhoomi AER\n\n[View Full Reel](/reels)\n\nExplore More Reelsin Borivali West\n\nWatch reels of other projects in the same locality\n\n[Watch All Reels](/reels)\n\nWatch This Project Reel\n\nSee highlights of Bhoomi AER\n\n[View Full Reel](/reels)\n\nExplore More Reelsin Borivali West\n\nWatch reels of other projects in the same locality\n\n[Watch All Reels](/reels)\n\n## Bhoomi AER Overview\n\n![Land Parcel](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fland-parcel-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n2.5 acres\n\nLand Parcel\n\n![Towers](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fnumber-of-towers-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n2\n\nTowers\n\n![Floors](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fnumber-of-floors-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nG+5P+33\n\nFloors\n\n![Config](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fconfig-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n3, 4 BHK\n\nConfig\n\n![Carpet Area](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fcarpet-area-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1184-2368 sqft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![RERA NO.](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2FRERA-number-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nPM1180002600498\n\nRERA NO.\n\n![Possession Status](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fpossession-status-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nEarly Stage (2-3 yrs)\n\nPossession Status\n\n![Target Possession](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Ftarget-possession-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nDec 2028\n\nTarget Possession\n\n![RERA Possession](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2FRERA-possession-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nDec 2031\n\nRERA Possession\n\n![Litigation](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Flitigation-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nNo\n\nLitigation\n\n### About Bhoomi AER\n\nBhoomi Borivali West Project Overview  \nBhoomi AER Project will be constructed on 2.50 acres of land parcel, 2 towers with G+5P+33 floors having 3 BHK, 4 BHK, premium residences .  \n  \nBhoomi AER Location  \nProject is located On Saibaba Mandir Rd, Saibaba Ngr, Borivali West, Mumbai with -  \nDMart - 850m  \nShimpoli Metro - 1.2km  \nBorivali Station - 2.3km  \n  \nBhoomi AER Borivali West Project Amenities  \nFirst is Internal amenities -  \nVitrified Tiles, Granite Platform, SS sink, CP fitting, Digital Door Lock & many more  \n  \nBhoomi Group Borivali West External Amenities  \nProject has 15+ amenities with likes of -  \nSwimming Pool  \nGymnasium  \nKids Play Area  \nYoga Wellness Zone  \nMultipurpose Court & many more  \n  \nBhoomi Group AER Borivali West Parking -  \nProject has one type of car parking facility -  \n1) Podium  \n  \nBhoomi AER Possession -  \nRera Possession - December 2031  \nTarget Possession - December 2028  \n  \nCarpet Area & Floor Plan  \nBhoomi AER Borivali West project has 3BHK, 4BHK premium residences with -  \n3BHK - 1184 sqft  \n4BHK - (1556 to 2368) sqft  \n  \nBhoomi AER floor plan  \nTower floor plan will have 8 flats 5 lifts & 2 staircases on each floor  \n  \nBhoomi AER Mumbai Prices & its details can be found in the price section & Bhoomi AER Borivali West brochure can be downloaded from the link mentioned below. Project has been praised by the home buyers & Bhoomi Group Borivali West review is 4 out of 5 from over all the clients who have visited the site\n\n## Bhoomi AER Location\n\nOn Saibaba Mandir Rd, Saibaba Ngr, Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n* DMart - 850m\n* Shimpoli Metro Station - 1.2km\n* Borivali Railway Station - 2.3km\n\n![360 background](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2F360-background-image.webp&w=1280&q=75)\n\n![Housiey Logo](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Flogo1.png&w=256&q=75)\n\n![360](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2F360-tour-icon.png&w=128&q=75)\n\n## Bhoomi AER Videos\n\n## Bhoomi AER Pros & Cons\n\n![Pros-icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fthumbs-up-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nPros\n\n![toggle-arrow](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Farrow-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1.The project offers large carpet areas in 3 & 4 BHK configurations – a rare find in today’s market where most builders focus on compact layouts. So, if you prefer spacious homes, this project is a perfect fit.\n\n![Cons-icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fthumbs-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nCons\n\n![toggle-arrow](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Farrow-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1.Project possession is late around 2031, so if you looking to shift in next 1-2 years, then this project won't be fit for you.\n\n## Bhoomi AER Amenities\n\n### Internal Amenities\n\n![Digital Lock](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652425081443-img.webp)\n\nDigital Lock\n\n![Vitrified Tiles](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652438961711-img.webp)\n\nVitrified Tiles\n\n![Granite Kitchen Platform](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/granite-kitchen-platform_External_1770712604025-330259421.webp)\n\nGranite Kitchen Platform\n\n![Stainless Steel Sink](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1646987626444-img.webp)\n\nStainless Steel Sink\n\n![Fire Fighting](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/fire-fighting_External_1770712237914-35127023.webp)\n\nFire Fighting\n\n### External Amenities\n\n![Swimming Pool](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652447054692-img.webp)\n\nSwimming Pool\n\n![Kids Play Area](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652446278292-img.webp)\n\nKids Play Area\n\n![Jogging Track](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/jogging-track_External_1770724897454-7779386.webp)\n\nJogging Track\n\n![Garden](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/garden_External_1770724836898-39687774.webp)\n\nGarden\n\n![Multi Purpose Court](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652446516876-img.webp)\n\nMulti Purpose Court\n\n![Senior Citizen Area](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652446899508-img.webp)\n\nSenior Citizen Area\n\n![Yoga Zone](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652447479516-img.webp)\n\nYoga Zone\n\n![Meditation Zone](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652446402032-img.webp)\n\nMeditation Zone\n\n![Banquet Hall](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/banquet-hall_External_1770879343210-675134790.webp)\n\nBanquet Hall\n\n![Seating Area](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/seating-area_External_1770882751990-34368358.webp)\n\nSeating Area\n\n![Gymnasium](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/gymnasium_External_1770730220696-33756910.webp)\n\nGymnasium\n\n## Bhoomi AER Master & Floor Plan\n\n### Master Plan\n\n![Bhoomi AER Master Plan](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/bhoomi-aer_1775307478221-567967747-1280w.webp)\n\n### Floor Plan\n\n![Bhoomi AER Floor plan 1](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/bhoomi-aer_1775307481484-215198228.webp)![Bhoomi AER Floor plan 2](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/bhoomi-aer_1775307485151-196774433.webp)\n\n## Bhoomi AER Pricing & Unit Plans\n\n| Carpet Area | All Inc. Price  (Inc. of Taxes & Charges) | Min Downpayment  (Inc. Taxes) | Parking | Unit Plan |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 1184 sqft | 5.25 Cr All In | 79.00 Lacs | 2 |\n\nCarpet:1184 sqft\n\n![Unit plan - 1184 sq.ft.](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/unit_plans/image_0_1780553761423-253836395.webp)\n\n5.25 CrAll Inc. Price(Inc. of Taxes & Charges)\n\n79.00 Lacs\n\nMin Downpayment(Inclusive Taxes)\n\n2Parking\n\nDown Payment\n\nLoan Amount\n\nInterest\n\nDuration\n\n₹0EMI\n\n## Bhoomi AER Payment Scheme\n\nRegular Standard Slabwise Payment as per construction, Maximum loan possible up to 90%\n\n## Bhoomi AER Litigation Details\n\nIs there any litigation against this proposed project:\n\nNo\n\n## Documents For Bhoomi AER\n\n![category icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Flegal-paper-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\n### Commencement Certificate\n\n![pdf icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fpdf-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\nBhoomi AER Commencement Certificate\n\n![category icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Flegal-paper-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\n### Legal Title Report\n\n![pdf icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fpdf-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\nBhoomi AER Legal Title Report\n\n![category icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Flegal-paper-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\n### Layout Plan\n\n![pdf icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fpdf-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\nBhoomi AER Building / Layout Plan\n\nNote: You can download more detailed documents by following this [link](https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/public/project/view/64144)\n\n## Bhoomi AER QR Codes\n\n[![RERA QR code - PM1180002600498](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/RERA-QR-images/rera_qr_code_1784028731382-886274435.webp)\n\nPM1180002600498](https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/public/project/view/64144)\n\n## Project approved by\n\n## About Bhoomi Group\n\nBhoomi Group\n\n![Bhoomi Group](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/builders/bhoomi-properties_1740058577241-218959416.webp)\n\n1 CityLocations\n\nPune\n\n32 yearsExperience\n\n50Total Projects\n\n12K+Happy Families\n\nSince its foundation in 1993, Bhoomi Group has been creating values in people’s lives by delivering happiness at their doorstep. With over 25 years of propelling experience in the construction industry, we have created our own benchmarks with the upgrading times in terms of creating the ideal blend of innovation and experience making us one of the leading builders today.\n\n## Frequently Asked Question\n\nThe sample flat is not ready yet. However, Housiey provides detailed floor plans, 3D walkthroughs, and virtual consultations with a property expert. Our team can explain the layout, unit sizes, and project details in detail.\n\nThe expected possession date is **01 December 2031** as per RERA. Construction is currently **10%** complete as of July 19, 2026. Target possession is **01 December 2028**.\n\nYes, it is RERA registered. The RERA number is **PM1180002600498**.  \nYou can verify it on the official RERA portal: <https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/public/project/view/64144>\n\nNo, it has no pending litigation. All legal documents including the Commencement Certificate and Legal Title Report are available on Housiey for review before booking.\n\nThe following legal documents are available on Housiey: **Commencement Certificate**, **Legal Title Report**, **Layout Plan**, **Proforma Allotment Letter**, **Proforma Sale Agreement**. You can preview them directly on the project page or verify them independently on the official RERA portal using RERA number **PM1180002600498**.\n\nThis project offers **16+** amenities. Key external amenities include Gymnasium, Seating Area, Banquet Hall, Meditation Zone, and Yoga Zone.  \n Internal specifications include Fire Fighting and Stainless Steel Sink. The complete amenities list is available on Housiey.\n\nMonthly maintenance details are available in the price sheet. You can download it from the project page on Housiey.\n\nIn Bhoomi AER, the 3BHK units are available in the following carpet area options:  \n• **1184 sq. ft.**  \nEach configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\n\nIn Bhoomi AER, the 4BHK units are available in the following carpet area options:  \n• **1556 sq. ft.**  \n• **2368 sq. ft.**  \nEach configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\n\nThe all-inclusive price of a 3BHK in Bhoomi AER starts from **₹5.25 Cr** and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• **1184 sq. ft.** – ₹5.25 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nThe all-inclusive price of a 4BHK in Bhoomi AER starts from **₹6.89 Cr** and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• **1556 sq. ft.** – ₹6.89 Cr (all-inclusive)  \n• **2368 sq. ft.** – ₹10.49 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nIt is built across **2.5 acres** with **2** towers with **G+5P+33** floors. Each floor has **8** flats per floor, **5** lifts, **2** staircases. It is available in **3BHK/4BHK** configurations with carpet areas ranging from **1184** to **2368 sq. ft.**\n\nBhoomi AER provides dedicated car parking facilities for residents. The exact parking type and the number of spaces allotted per unit are mentioned in the Unit Plan, which you can download for free on the Bhoomi AER project page on Housiey.\n\nIt is located at **On Saibaba Mandir Rd, Saibaba Ngr, Borivali West, Mumbai**.  \nNearby landmarks include:  \n**• DMart - 850m**   \n**• Shimpoli Metro Station - 1.2km**   \n**• Borivali Railway Station - 2.3km**\n\nThe following payment plans are available:  \n• **CLP ( Construction Link plan)** - Regular Standard Slabwise Payment as per construction, Maximum loan possible up to 90%  \n  \n**Note:** In some cases, payment plan deviations can be considered based on your preferred terms. The final schedule is confirmed after your site visit.\n\nThe minimum down payment starts from **₹79.00 Lacs**, inclusive of all taxes. EMI options are also available. Use the EMI calculator on the project page to check monthly instalments based on your loan amount and tenure.\n\nYes, it is approved by leading banks including **Central Bank of India**, **Union Bank of India**, **Bank Of India**, **Bank Of Baroda**, **Citi Bank**, **Kotak Mahindra Bank**, **Axis Bank**, **State Bank Of India**, **ICICI Bank**, **HDFC BANK**. The complete approved bank list is available in the Banks section on Housiey. Home loan eligibility depends on the bank's lending policy and your profile.\n\nNo - Housiey follows a strict no-brokerage policy. You pay only the builder's official price - no commission, no hidden charges, and no middlemen. This applies to all projects listed on Housiey.\n\nIt is developed by **Bhoomi Group**, a trusted real estate brand with over **32 years** of experience and more than **50 completed projects** across **Pune**.  \n**Some of their notable developments include:**  \n  \n • **Bhoomi Sagar Manthan** in Kandivali West, Mumbai  \n  \n • **Bhoomi Celestia** in Malad West, Mumbai  \n  \n • **Bhoomi Lakescape** in Waghbil Thane, Mumbai  \n  \n • **Bhoomi Simana** in Parel, Mumbai  \n  \n • **Bhoomi Airavat** in Borivali West, Mumbai\n\nThe Commencement Certificate is available. The **Occupancy Certificate (OC)** will be applied for closer to the possession date, as per standard regulatory timelines. All currently available documents are listed in the Documents section on Housiey.\n\nYes - book a free site visit through Housiey. We arrange a free Ola cab pickup and drop from your location.  \n  \nAlternatively, you can schedule an online project presentation directly by the builder from home. Both options are 100% free with no obligation to buy.\n\nYes - NRIs can purchase this project under FEMA regulations. Payment can be made via NRE or NRO accounts. Home loans are available from Indian banks with a co-applicant. Housiey's team assists NRI buyers with documentation and Power of Attorney requirements remotely - 100% free.\n\n**Borivali West** is one of Mumbai's sought-after micro-markets with consistent property appreciation.  \n  \nThis project by **Bhoomi Group** - with 32 years of experience - offers 3BHK/4BHK at ₹5.25 Cr to ₹10.49 Cr, making it a strong long-term investment opportunity.\n\nBuying through Housiey gives you:  \n(1) No brokerage - you pay the builder's exact price  \n(2) Free Ola cab site visit  \n(3) Online project presentation by the builder from home  \n(4) Free legal consultation via Housiey Legal  \n(5) Honest Pros & Cons review on every project  \nAll services are 100% free with no obligation.\n\nThe price sheet and brochure for this project are available for free download on Housiey. Click the \"Price Sheet\" or \"Brochure\" button on the project page. No registration is required for instant download.\n\nHousiey has a **4.8 rating** on Google with **2,395+ reviews**.  \n  \nOver **8,500 families** have purchased homes through Housiey across **8+ cities** with no brokerage and direct builder pricing. Housiey has conducted **1.2 lakh+ free site visits** and facilitated over **₹8,000 crore** worth of property transactions.\n\n## Explore Related Projects\n\n![DSD Aura](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/DSD_Aura_Elevation--1694329813038-img-1280w.webp)\n\n[### DSD Aura](/projects/dsd-aura)\n\n₹ 4.70 Cr (All inc)\n\n[DSD Group](/builder/dsd-group)\n\n890- 1941sqft\n\nBorivali West\n\nReady\n\n3BHKLimited\n\n1230sqft\n\n₹4.70 Cr\n\n2BHKSold Out\n\n890sqft\n\n-\n\n3BHKSold Out\n\n1200sqft\n\n-\n\n3BHKSold Out\n\n1309sqft\n\n-\n\n4BHKSold Out\n\n1420sqft\n\n-\n\n4BHKSold Out\n\n1515sqft\n\n-\n\n4BHKSold Out\n\n1941sqft\n\n-\n\n[DSD Group](/builder/dsd-group)Developer\n