 Kandivali West by Bhoomi Shashwat Estate Pvt Ltd and has a price range of Rs. 5.25 Cr -... Read More\n\nProject Details\n\nAbout Bhoomi Airavat\n\nBhoomi Airavat is an under-construction residential project in Kandivali West by Bhoomi Shashwat Estate Pvt Ltd and has a price range of Rs. 5.25 Cr - 10.49 Cr. The project covers an area of 2 acres and has 4 towers with 460 apartments. The buyers will find 1, 2, 3, and 4 BHK flats with super built-up areas of 489 sq. ft. to 2654 sq. ft available for purchase. The project will be completed by December 2031. Bhoomi Airavat is RERA-approved with the registration number PM1180002600498.\n\n### Bhoomi Airavat: Key Facts\n\n*   Buyers get 4 apartments in 1, 2, 3, and 4 BHK configurations.\n\n*   Bhoomi Airavat covers an area of roughly 2 acres with 460 residential units.\n\n*   One of the best features is its proximity to Poisar Metro Station at a distance of 0.6 km.\n\n*   Bhoomi Airavat is still under construction and will be handed over from December 2031.\n\n*   There are eight different sizes of apartments available.\n\n*   Bhoomi Airavat’s location on Sai Baba Mandir Road in Kandivali West provides easy accessibility to the best schools and shopping complexes.\n\n*   Bhoomi Airavat is situated at a distance of around 1.8 km from Kandivali Railway Station on the Western Line.\n\n*   Bhoomi Airavat's amenities include a grand entrance lobby and a rooftop garden. There is also CCTV security and an intercom facility.\n\n### Why Buy Bhoomi Airavat\n\n*   Buyers get to pick from small 1 BHK to large 4 BHK homes.\n\n*   Bhoomi Airavat is within 10-15 minutes of Link Road, SV Road and Western Express Highway.\n\n*   It offers the convenience of daily commutation as Metro line 2A stations and Kandivali Railway Station are located nearby.\n\n*   The distance to Kalpataru Mall is only 300 metres and makes it easier for you to go shopping and dining.\n\n*   The project is designed to be limited to 460 units across 3 towers to maintain a lower density than that of larger township projects.\n\n*   The multi-layer CCTV monitoring add value for residents who are concerned about safety.\n\n*   The big apartment sizes are ideal for those looking to upgrade.\n\n*   Rooftop garden space offers an outdoor relaxation place.\n\n*   Bhoomi Airavat has its own play areas for children.\n\n*   The buyers benefit from close proximity to shopping centers for everyday convenience.\n\n### What People Are Saying About Bhoomi Airavat\n\n*   Bhoomi Airavat's accessibility by walking to the Metro Line 2A stations has garnered buyers' interest.\n\n*   Many Bhoomi Airavat reviews mention Kandivali West's established residential infrastructure and retail markets.\n\n*   Bhoomi Airavat’s price sits well with buyers looking for premium, spacious apartments.\n\n*   Buyers mention the easy connectivity to the metro and railway stations.\n\n### Bhoomi Airavat: Location & Connectivity\n\n*   Kandivali Railway Station is located at a distance of about 1.8 km.\n\n*   The Mumbai Metro Line 2A Poisar Metro Station is 0.6 km away from Bhoomi Airavat.\n\n*   The Western Express Highway is approximately 3.5 to 4 km away.\n\n*   Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport is around 17 km away\n\n*   Bhoomi Airavat is around 1.8km from V Mall.\n\n*   Sai Baba Mandir Road is near Link Road and SV Road, which are easily accessible by a short drive.\n\n### Amenities Offered in Bhoomi Airavat\n\n*   The rooftop garden gives you ample open space to relax.\n\n*   Bhoomi Airavat has a special kids' area as well.\n\n*   A multi-level security system with CCTV and round-the-clock security guards will take care of your safety.\n\n*   The intercom facility will allow communication between apartments and security guards.\n\n*   Vertical access is planned through passenger lifts within Bhoomi Airavat to improve ease of access.\n\nBhoomi Airavat is a Under Construction project by Bhoomi Group in Borivali West Mumbai, offering 1,2,3,4 BHK Flats configuration. Below are the key details of Bhoomi Airavat. \nBhoomi Airavat Price Rs. 5.25 Cr - 10.49 Cr\nProperty Types Flat\nProject Type Residential\nBhoomi Airavat Status Under Construction\nBhoomi Airavat Launch Date 01 May 2026\nBhoomi Airavat Possession Date 01 December 2031\nTowers in Bhoomi Airavat 3\n Bhoomi Airavat is a well-known project located in Borivali West, Mumbai, offering premium properties in the price range of Rs. 5.25 Cr - 10.49 Cr. Bhoomi Airavat has been developed by the well-known builder Bhoomi Group. As of the latest update, the project is in the Under Construction phase. Covering 2 Acre, it offers ample open space and living spaces. The entire project consists of over 460 residential units.\n\nThere are 3 residential towers in the project. The official launch date for the project was May 2026.The possession of Bhoomi Airavat starts from December 2031. The site's exact address is 18.30 Mt. Wide Sai Baba Mandir Road, Kandivali, Borivali, Mumbai, Maharashtra.400092 is the area pincode under which this project falls.\n\n### Bhoomi Airavat Floor Plan\n\n| Unit Configuration | Unit Size |\n| --- | --- |\n| Bhoomi Airavat 1 BHK Flat | 502 Sq. Ft. |\n| Bhoomi Airavat 1 BHK Flat | 489 Sq. Ft. |\n| Bhoomi Airavat 2 BHK Flat | 778 Sq. Ft. |\n| Bhoomi Airavat 2 BHK Flat | 584 Sq. Ft. |\n| Bhoomi Airavat 3 BHK Flat | 1867 Sq. Ft. |\n| Bhoomi Airavat 3 BHK Flat | 1184 Sq. Ft. |\n| Bhoomi Airavat 3 BHK Flat | 1259 Sq. Ft. |\n| Bhoomi Airavat 4 BHK Flat | 1556 Sq. Ft. |\n| Bhoomi Airavat 4 BHK Flat | 2654 Sq. Ft. |\n| Bhoomi Airavat 4 BHK Flat | 2368 Sq. Ft. |\n To know more about the layout, it is best to study the floor plan. The floor plan provides a bird's eye view of the house structure. At Bhoomi Airavat, you are offered as many as 10 configuration, available in 26 types of floor plans. The bathrooms are fixed with world-class fittings. Balconies are well-ventilated in all the configurations. Magicbricks enumerates different configurations of Bhoomi Airavat across a range of unit sizes.\n\n### Bhoomi Airavat Brochure\n\n Wish to know more about Bhoomi Airavat? Download this comprehensive brochure to get the full details. The brochure is accessible from the top right end of the page, under the link 'Download Brochure'The brochure of Bhoomi Airavat can easily be downloaded by providing your name, contact number and email address.\n\nProject Summary is Ai Generated\n\nKey Highlights\n\nAmenities\n\n## Ratings & Reviews\n\n for Borivali West\n\nLocality\n\n4.2\n\nAverage Rating\n\n(376 Total Reviews)\n\nOverall Rating\n\n5\n\n4\n\n3\n\n2\n\n1\n\nEnvironment\n\n4.2/5\n\nNeighbourhood\n\nRoads\n\nSafety\n\nCleanliness\n\nCommuting\n\n4/5\n\nPublic Transport\n\nParking\n\nConnectivity\n\nTraffic\n\nPlaces of Interest\n\n4.3/5\n\nSchools\n\nHospitals\n\nRestaurants\n\nMarkets\n\nLocality Reviews\n\nG\n\nGuest User\n\nOwner\n\n17/02/2026\n\nIdeal Balance of Ease, Amenities, and Green Space\n\nIdeal Balance of Ease, Amenities, and Green SpaceBorivali West truly feels like home. Daily needs ar... Show More\n\nG\n\nGuest User\n\nOwner\n\n13/02/2026\n\nGreen & Connected Suburb Living Borivali West\n\nGreen & Connected Suburb Living Borivali West blends city convenience with nature - Sanjay Gandhi Na... Show More\n\nView All Reviews (376)\n\nRating and Reviews\n\nG\n\nGuest User\n\nOwner\n\n17/02/2026\n\nIdeal Balance of Ease, Amenities, and Green Space\n\nIdeal Balance of Ease, Amenities, and Green SpaceBorivali West truly feels like home. Daily needs ar... Show More\n\nG\n\nGuest User\n\nOwner\n\n13/02/2026\n\nGreen & Connected Suburb Living Borivali West\n\nGreen & Connected Suburb Living Borivali West blends city convenience with nature - Sanjay Gandhi Na... Show More\n\nG\n\nGuest User\n\nOwner\n\n12/02/2026\n\nFamily-Friendly Yet Vibrant Locale As a family\n\nFamily-Friendly Yet Vibrant LocaleAs a family resident, I love the strong social infrastructure here... Show More\n\nD\n\nDharmesh\n\nOwner\n\n06/05/2025\