e of Bhoomi Airavat?\n\nBhoomi Airavat has already been launched in May 2026. \n\n### What is the total area of Bhoomi Airavat?\n\nBhoomi Airavat in Mumbai spans a total area of 2 acres.\n\n### How many units are in Bhoomi Airavat?\n\nBhoomi Airavat has a total of 460 units. These units are located in 3 towers, with each tower offering a mix of 3,4 BHK Flats.\n\n### What is the current status of Bhoomi Airavat?\n\nThe current status of the Bhoomi Airavat is Under Construction. To know more about this project, check out [Bhoomi Airavat project details](https://www.magicbricks.com/bhoomi-airavat-borivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343531303031).\n\n### How many towers in Bhoomi Airavat?\n\nBhoomi Airavat has a total of 3 towers in different unit configurations.\n\n### What is the price of Bhoomi Airavat apartments?\n\nThe residential property in Bhoomi Airavat in Borivali West, Mumbai typically range from 5.25 Cr to 10.49 Cr.\n\n### What is the price of 3 BHK in Bhoomi Airavat, Mumbai?\n\nAt Bhoomi Airavat, the sale price of 3 BHK starts from ₹ 5.25 Cr Onwards.\n\n### What is the price of 4 BHK in Bhoomi Airavat, Mumbai?\n\nAt Bhoomi Airavat, its top-of-the-class 4 BHK can cost between ₹ 6.89 Cr - 10.49 Cr.\n\nShow more\n\ni\n\nThis project was last updated on 08 September 2026\n\nProperties for Sale\n\n*   [Properties for Sale in Bhoomi Airavat](https://www.magicbricks.com/project-bhoomi-airavat-3bhk-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n*   [Properties for Sale in Bhoomi Airavat](https://www.magicbricks.com/project-bhoomi-airavat-4bhk-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n*   [Properties for Sale in Bhoomi Airavat](https://www.magicbricks.com/project-bhoomi-airavat-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n\nQuick Links\n\n*   [Bhoomi Airavat Location](https://www.magicbricks.com/bhoomi-airavat-location-borivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343531303031)\n*   [Bhoomi Airavat Photos Videos](https://www.magicbricks.com/bhoomi-airavat-photo-videos-borivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343531303031)\n*   [Bhoomi Airava