 in Mumbai](https://www.magicbricks.com/property-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n*   [Property in Chennai](https://www.magicbricks.com/property-for-sale-in-chennai-pppfs)\n*   [Property in Pune](https://www.magicbricks.com/property-for-sale-in-pune-pppfs)\n*   [Property in Noida](https://www.magicbricks.com/property-for-sale-in-noida-pppfs)\n*   [Property in Gurgaon](https://www.magicbricks.com/property-for-sale-in-gurgaon-pppfs)\n*   [Property in Bangalore](https://www.magicbricks.com/property-for-sale-in-bangalore-pppfs)\n*   [Property in Ahmedabad](https://www.magicbricks.com/property-for-sale-in-ahmedabad-pppfs)\n\nNew Projects in India\n\n*   [New Projects in New Delhi](https://www.magicbricks.com/new-projects-New-Delhi)\n*   [New Projects in Mumbai](https://www.magicbricks.com/new-projects-Mumbai)\n*   [New Projects in Chennai](https://www.magicbricks.com/new-projects-Chennai)\n*   [New Projects in Pune](https://www.magicbricks.com/new-projects-Pune)\n*   [New Projects in Noida](https://www.magicbricks.com/new-projects-Noida)\n*   [New Projects in Gurgaon](https://www.magicbricks.com/new-projects-Gurgaon)\n*   [New Projects in Bangalore](https://www.magicbricks.com/new-projects-Bangalore)\n*   [New Projects in Ahmedabad](https://www.magicbricks.com/new-projects-Ahmedabad)\n*   [MagicHomes](https://www.magicbricks.com/magichomes)\n\nProperty Services\n\n*   [Home Loan](https://www.magicbricks.com/homeloan/home?inc=homeloan_footer_property_services_home_loan_link)\n*   [Home Interior](https://www.magicbricks.com/home-interior/)\n\n*   [Sitemap](https://www.magicbricks.com/sitemap.html)\n*   [Terms & Conditions](https://property.magicbricks.com/terms/terms.html)\n*   [Privacy Policy](https://property.magicbricks.com/terms/privacy-policy.html)\n*   [Whistle Blower Policy](https://property.magicbricks.com/terms/whistle-blower-policy.html)\n*   [Blog](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/)\n*   [Careers](https://www.magicbricks.com/careers)\n*   [Testimonials](https://property.magicbricks.com/testimonials/testimonials.htm)\n*   [Unsubscribe](https://www.magicbricks.com/mbutility/unSubEmail)\n*   [Help Center](https://www.magicbricks.com/help/)\n*   [Sales Enquiry](https://www.magicbricks.com/contactUs)\n*   [Buy Services](https://www.magicbricks.com/advertise-with-us)\n*   [News](https://www.magicbricks.com/news/)\n\nDisclaimer: Magicbricks Realty Services Limited is only an intermediary offering its platform to advertise properties of Seller for a Customer/Buyer/User coming on its Website and is not and cannot be a party to or privy to or control in any manner any transactions between the Seller and the Customer/Buyer/User. All the offers and discounts on this Website have been extended by Read more various Builder(s)/Developer(s) who have advertised their products. Magicbricks is only communicating the offers and not selling or rendering any of those products or services. It neither warrants nor is it making any representations with respect to offer(s) made on the site. Magicbricks Realty Services Limited shall neither be responsible nor liable to mediate or resolve any disputes or disagreements between the Customer/Buyer/User and the Seller and both Seller and Customer/Buyer/User shall settle all such disputes without involving Magicbricks Realty Services Limited in any manner.\n\nAll trademarks, logos and names are properties of their respective owners. All Rights Reserved. © Copyright 2026 Magicbricks Realty Services Limited.","images":[]},{"url":"https://bhoomiairavat.co","title":"Bhoomi Airavat Borivali West, Mumbai | Luxury 3 & 4 BHK Deck ...","raw_content":"* ![Bhoomi Airavat, Borivali West - Twilight Tower View](./img/banner/Road_Cam_Twilight_Bhoomi%20Airavat_revised.jpg.jpeg)\n* ![Bhoomi Airavat, Borivali West - 38-Storey Elevation Front View](./img/banner/Shot_04_revised.jpg.jpeg)\n* ![Bhoomi Airavat - Borivali's Tallest 38-Storey Landmark](./img/banner/Bhoomi%20Group%20Creative%20Digital%20Kit-03.jpg)\n\n# Bhoomi Airavat\n\n## At Sai Baba Nagar, Borivali West\n\n### By Bhoomi Group · Near Gurudwara\n\n|  |  |\n| --- | --- |\n| Tower | 38 Storeys |\n| Residences | 198 (6/Floor) |\n| Possession | Dec 2030 |\n\n* Private Deck in Every Home\n* Only 6 Homes Per Floor\n* 11 ft Floor-to-Ceiling Height\n* Grand Double-Height Lobby\n* 45+ Lifestyle Amenities\n* Near Gurudwara & Upcoming Metro\n\n#### Luxurious 3 & 4 BHK Deck Residences Start At\n\n##### ₹ 5.33 Cr\\*\n\n###### RERA : PM1180002600498\n\n[Organize Site Visit](javascript:void(0))  [+91 9136936949](tel:+919136936949)\n\n##### Enquire Now\n\n![Free Pickup and Drop service for Bhoomi Airavat site visit](https://s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/microsites.images/temp_assets/temp-xi/img/ip.png) \n\n\n### Bhoomi Airavat, Borivali West — Now Accepting Bookings\n\nPresenting Bhoomi Airavat, an iconic 38-storey residential landmark rising in the heart of Borivali West. With just 198 exclusive residences and only 6 homes per floor, it delivers a rare, low-density living experience defined by privacy, space and lifetime open views.   \n   \n Every home is a 3 or 4 BHK deck residence with a private deck, an 11 ft floor-to-ceiling height and a grand double-height entrance lobby. Choose from spacious 3 & 4 BHK homes, or exclusive Jodi, Duplex, Triplex and Penthouse configurations crafted for those who aspire to live above the ordinary. Strategically located at Sai Baba Nagar near the Gurudwara, close to Kora Kendra and the upcoming Shimpoli Metro, Bhoomi Airavat offers seamless connectivity via Link Road, S.V. Road and the Western Express Highway, with Borivali and Kandivali stations close at hand. Backed by Bhoomi Developers — 33+ years of experience, 50 delivered projects and 15,000+ happy families — Bhoomi Airavat is more than a home; it is a statement address in one of Borivali West's most prestigious neighbourhoods.\n\n![Bhoomi Airavat, Borivali West - Project Overview](./img/banner/Road_Cam_Twilight_Bhoomi%20Airavat_revised.jpg.jpeg)\n\n### Area & Pricing\n\n* #### 3 BHK Deck\n\n  ##### 1184 Sq.ft Carpet\n\n  ###### ₹ 5.33 Cr\\* onwards\n* #### 4 BHK Deck\n\n  ##### 1556 Sq.ft Carpet\n\n  ###### ₹ 7.02 Cr\\* onwards\n* #### Jodi / Duplex / Penthouse\n\n  ##### Exclusive Configurations\n\n  ###### Price On Request\n* #### Commercial Shops\n\n  ##### 188 – 842 Sq.ft (1st Floor)\n\n  ###### ₹ 65,000+\\* / Sq.ft\n\n### Floor Plans\n\nSpacious 3 & 4 BHK deck residences, Jodi, Duplex & Penthouse homes — tap any plan to view full size.\n\n* [![Bhoomi Airavat 3 BHK Deck Floor Plan - 1184 Sq.ft](./img/floorplans/Bhoomi%20Group%20Floor%20Plans%20Digital%20Kit-01.jpg)](./img/floorplans/Bhoomi%20Group%20Floor%20Plans%20Digital%20Kit-01.jpg)3 BHK Deck · 1184 Sq.ft\n* [![Bhoomi Airavat 4 BHK Deck Floor Plan - 1556 Sq.ft](./img/floorplans/Bhoomi%20Group%20Floor%20Plans%20Digital%20Kit-02.jpg)](./img/floorplans/Bhoomi%20Group%20Floor%20Plans%20Digital%20Kit-02.jpg)4 BHK Deck · 1556 Sq.ft\n* [![Bhoomi Airavat Jodi Apartment Floor Plan - 2368 Sq.ft](./img/floorplans/Bhoomi%20Group%20Floor%20Plans%20Digital%20Kit-03.jpg)](./img/floorplans/Bhoomi%20Group%20Floor%20Plans%20Digital%20Kit-03.jpg)Jodi · 2368 Sq.ft\n* [![Bhoomi Airavat Duplex Floor Plan - 5308 Sq.ft](./img/floorplans/Bhoomi%20Group%20Floor%20Plans%20Digital%20Kit-04.jpg)](./img/floorplans/Bhoomi%20Group%20Floor%20Plans%20Digital%20Kit-04.jpg)Duplex · 5308 Sq.ft\n* [![Bhoomi Airavat Duplex Floor Plan - 3734 Sq.ft](./img/floorplans/Bhoomi%20Group%20Floor%20Plans%20Digital%20Kit-05.jpg)](./img/floorplans/Bhoomi%20Group%20Floor%20Plans%20Digital%20Kit-05.jpg)Duplex · 3734 Sq.ft\n* [![Bhoomi Airavat Penthouse Upper Level Floor Plan](./img/floorplans/Bhoomi%20Group%20Floor%20Plans%20Digital%20Kit-06.jpg)](./img/floorplans/Bhoomi%20Group%20Floor%20Plans%20Digital%20Kit-06.jpg)Penthouse / Upper Level\n* [![Bhoomi Airavat Typical Floor Plan - 6 Homes Per Floor](./img/floorplans/Bhoomi%20Group%20Floor%20Plans%20Digital%20Kit-07.jpg)](./img/floorplans/Bhoomi%20Group%20Floor%20Plans%20Digital%20Kit-07.jpg)Typical Floor Plan\n\n### World-Class Amenities\n\nA resort-inspired lifestyle with 45+ ultra-luxury amenities designed for every age group.\n\nSwimming Pool\n\nGymnasium\n\nYoga & Meditation\n\nMiyawaki Garden\n\nJogging Track\n\nCricket Turf\n\nSports Court\n\nIndoor Games\n\nBanquet Hall\n\nKids’ Play Area\n\nSenior Citizen Corner\n\nDouble-Height Lobby\n\n24×7 Security & CCTV\n\nModern Parking\n\nLifetime Open Views\n\n& 45+ More\n\n### Project Gallery\n\n### Location Advantage\n\n![Bhoomi Airavat at Sai Baba Nagar, Borivali West - Prime Location](./img/banner/Road_Cam_Twilight_Bhoomi%20Airavat_revised.jpg.jpeg)\n\n* Gurudwara, Sai Baba Nagar - 2 mins\n* Kora Kendra Ground - Walking Distance\n* Shimpoli Metro Station (Upcoming) - 5 mins\n* Borivali Railway Station - 8 mins\n* Kandivali Railway Station - 10 mins\n* Link Road - 5 mins\n* S.V. Road - 4 mins\n* Western Express Highway - 10 mins\n* Jain Derasar & Haveli - Nearby\n* Schools, Hospitals & Malls - Nearby\n\n## \n\n* Gurudwara, Sai Baba Nagar - 2 mins\n* Kora Kendra Ground - Walking Distance\n* Shimpoli Metro Station (Upcoming) - 5 mins\n* Borivali Railway Station - 8 mins\n* Kandivali Railway Station - 10 mins\n* Link Road - 5 mins\n* S.V. Road - 4 mins\n* Western Express Highway - 10 mins\n* Jain Derasar & Haveli - Nearby\n* Schools, Hospitals & Malls - Nearby\n\n### Schedule a Site Visit\n\n![Schedule a Site Visit for Bhoomi Airavat, Borivali West](./img/banner/Shot_04_revised.jpg.jpeg)\n\nAbout Bhoomi Group\n\nWith over three decades of excellence, Bhoomi Developers (Bhoomi Group) has established itself as one of Mumbai’s most trusted real estate brands. Backed by 33+ years of experience, the group has successfully delivered 50 projects, developed over 1 crore sq.ft and handed over homes to 15,000+ happy families. According to the RERA Act 2016 of the Government of India, all projects of Bhoomi Group, including Bhoomi Airavat, are listed on the Maharashtra Government’s RERA website under registered projects (RERA No. PM1180002600498).\n\nRERA Authorised Advertiser: Mohammed Javed, RERA Registration No. A51900016524. Developer: Bhoomi Shashwat Estate Private Limited.\n\n### Bhoomi Airavat — Frequently Asked Questions\n\nEverything you need to know about Bhoomi Airavat, Borivali West.\n\n## \n\nBhoomi Airavat is located at Sai Baba Nagar, near the Gurudwara, in Borivali West, Mumbai 400092 — close to Kora Kendra Ground and the upcoming Shimpoli Metro station, with easy access to Link Road, S.V. Road and the Western Express Highway.\n\n## \n\nBhoomi Airavat offers 3 BHK (1184 sq.ft carpet) and 4 BHK (1556 sq.ft carpet) deck residences, along with exclusive Jodi, Duplex, Triplex and Penthouse homes, plus commercial shops (188–842 sq.ft) on the first floor.\n\n## \n\n3 BHK deck residences start from ₹5.33 Cr\\* all-inclusive and 4 BHK deck residences from ₹7.02 Cr\\* all-inclusive. Jodi, Duplex and Penthouse homes are available on request. Prices are indicative and subject to change.\n\n## \n\nPossession of Bhoomi Airavat is targeted for December 2030, with RERA completion in December 2031.\n\n## \n\nThe MahaRERA registration number of Bhoomi Airavat is PM1180002600498. The authorised advertiser RERA number is A51900016524. You can verify project details on the official MahaRERA website.\n\n## \n\nBhoomi Airavat is a 38-storey landmark tower with only 198 residences and just 6 homes per floor, with an 11 ft floor-to-ceiling height and a grand double-height entrance lobby.\n\n## \n\nBhoomi Airavat offers 45+ amenities including a swimming pool, gymnasium, yoga & meditation zone, Miyawaki garden, jogging track, cricket turf, multipurpose sports court, indoor games, banquet hall, children's play area, senior citizen corner and 24x7 security.\n\n## \n\nBhoomi Airavat is developed by Bhoomi Group (Bhoomi Shashwat Estate Private Limited), with 33+ years of experience, 50 delivered projects, 15,000+ happy families and over 1 crore sq.ft developed.\n\n[Call](tel:+919136936949)  [Enquire](javascript:void(0))  [WhatsApp](https://wa.link/2zfuyq)\n\n### Enquire Now\n\n* We Promise\n* **Instant** Call Back\n* **Free** Site Visit\n* **Unmatched** Price\n\n##### Get information on availabilities\n\nAvailable units\n\nPayment plan\n\nFloor plans\n\n##### Descriptive brochure\n\nFloor plans\n\n ","images":[]},{"url":"https://houssed.com/mumbai/bhoomi-group/bhoomi-airavat-159614","title":"Bhoomi Airavat, Borivali West, Mumbai | 3 & 4 BHK Ultra ... - Houssed","raw_content":"[![Houssed](/assets/images/houssed_logo.svg)](/)\n\n[![whatsapp](/assets/images/whatsapp.svg)Connect Now](https://api.whatsapp.com/send/?phone=918169114718&text=Hi%2C+I%27m+looking+to+Buy+a+residential+property+in+Mumbai.+Please+connect+with+me.+Thanks%21&type=phone_number&app_absent=0)\n\n![Project Image of Bhoomi Airavat in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 414772](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/159614/Project_Image/1-1780402836.webp)\n\nNew Launch  Ultra Luxury\n\n![Project Image of Bhoomi Airavat in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 414773](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/159614/Project_Image/8-1780402836.webp)\n\nNew Launch  Ultra Luxury\n\n![Project Image of Bhoomi Airavat in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 414774](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/159614/Project_Image/58-1780402836.webp)\n\nNew Launch  Ultra Luxury\n\n![Project Image of Bhoomi Airavat in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 414775](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/159614/Project_Image/11-1780402836.webp)\n\nNew Launch  Ultra Luxury\n\n![Project Image of Bhoomi Airavat in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 414776](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/159614/Project_Image/9-1780402836.webp)\n\nNew Launch  Ultra Luxury\n\n![Project Image of Bhoomi Airavat in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 414777](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/159614/Project_Image/10-1780402836.webp)\n\nNew Launch  Ultra Luxury\n\n![Project Image of Bhoomi Airavat in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 414778](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/159614/Project_Image/12-1780402836.webp)\n\nNew Launch  Ultra Luxury\n\n![Amenities of Bhoomi Airavat in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 414779](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/159614/Amenities/2-1780402845.webp)\n\nNew Launch  Ultra Luxury\n\n![Amenities of Bhoomi Airavat in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 414780](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/159614/Amenities/5-1780402845.webp)\n\nNew Launch  Ultra Luxury\n\n![Amenities of Bhoomi Airavat in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 414781](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/159614/Amenities/4-1780402845.webp)\n\nNew Launch  Ultra Luxury\n\n![Amenities of Bhoomi Airavat in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 414782](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/159614/Amenities/3-1780402845.webp)\n\nNew Launch  Ultra Luxury\n\n![Amenities of Bhoomi Airavat in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 414783](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/159614/Amenities/6-1780402845.webp)\n\nNew Launch  Ultra Luxury\n\n![Amenities of Bhoomi Airavat in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 414784](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/159614/Amenities/7-1780402845.webp)\n\nNew Launch  Ultra Luxury\n\n![Location of Bhoomi Airavat in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 414785](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/159614/Location/untitled-1-1780402924.webp)\n\nNew Launch  Ultra Luxury\n\n## Project Overview of Bhoomi Airavat Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\nProject Status\n\nNew Launch\n\nNo. of Units\n\n435 Units\n\nProject Area\n\n1.54 Acres\n\nTowers / Floors\n\n3 Towers / 32 Floors\n\nProperty View\n\nOpen View\n\nParking\n\nTwo Wheeler, Four Wheeler\n\nAirport\n\n19 KM | 35 Minutes\n\nNear Railway Station\n\n3 KM | 10 Minutes\n\nNear Metro\n\n1.5 KM | 5 Minutes\n\n---\n\nBhoomi Airavat is a premium residential project crafted to offer an elevated lifestyle in a well-connected and desirable location. Designed with a focus on modern living, the development combines architectural elegance with practical functionality, making it an ideal choice for homebuyers and investors alike. Every residence is thoughtfully planned to maximize space, natural light, and ventilation, creating a comfortable and welcoming environment for families. With its contemporary design and attention to detail, Bhoomi Airavat delivers a harmonious balance between luxury and everyday convenience.  \n  \nThe project features high-quality construction, luxurious fixtures, premium fittings, and elegant interiors that enhance the overall living experience. Residents can enjoy beautifully designed homes that reflect sophistication while meeting the needs of modern urban lifestyles. The development emphasizes comfort, privacy, and durability, ensuring long-term value for homeowners. Whether it is the stylish finishes, well-planned layouts, or superior craftsmanship, every aspect of Bhoomi Airavat is designed to provide a refined and hassle-free residential experience.  \n  \nBhoomi Airavat is an excellent choice for those looking for luxury apartments, premium residences, modern homes, residential property, spacious flats, real estate investment, upscale living, contemporary housing, quality construction, and family-friendly homes. Combining convenience, comfort, and elegance, the project stands out as a sought-after residential destination for individuals and families seeking a superior lifestyle in a thriving neighborhood.\n\n## Floor Plans & Pricing of Bhoomi Airavat Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n![3 BHK Flat in Bhoomi Airavat in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 923229](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/159614/BHK_Configuration/3-bhk-1184-ca-1780402788.webp)\n\n3 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n1184 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n5.33 Cr\n\n![4 BHK Flat in Bhoomi Airavat in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 923230](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/159614/BHK_Configuration/4-bhk-1556-ca-1780402796.webp)\n\n4 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n1556 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n7.02 Cr\n\n![5 BHK Flat in Bhoomi Airavat in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 923231](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/159614/BHK_Configuration/5-bhk-2368-ca-1780402806.webp)\n\n5 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n2368 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n10.68 Cr\n\n![5 BHK Duplex in Bhoomi Airavat in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 923232](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/159614/BHK_Configuration/5-bhk-duplex-3734-ca-1780402815.webp)\n\n5 BHK Duplex\n\nCarpet Area\n\n3734 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n16.8 Cr\n\n![Floor Plan of Bhoomi Airavat in Borivali West, Mumbai - Image 414786](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/159614/Floor_Plan/fp-1780402935.webp)\n\nFloor Plan\n\n## Key Features of Bhoomi Airavat Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* Scenic Views.\n* Trendy Fixtures.\n* Green Lush Space.\n* Games Zones.\n* Lavish Clubhouse.\n* Serene Green View.\n\n## Amenities Bhoomi Airavat Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* 24X7 Water Supply\n* Lift\n* Security\n* Visitor Parking\n* Mud Playing Zone\n* Meditation Zone\n* Recycle Zone\n* Pets Zone\n* Children Playing Zone\n* Senior Citizen Sitting Area\n* Dth And Broadband Connection\n* Multipurpose Hall\n* Society Office\n* Convenience Store\n* Relaxation Zone\n* Drop-Off Zone\n\n* Club House\n* Reserved Parking\n* Maintenance Staff\n* Cctv Surveillance\n* Entrance Gate With Security\n* Fire Fighting System\n* 24/7 Security\n* Fireplace\n\n* Gymnasium\n* Kids Play Area\n* Lattu Game\n* Game Corners\n* Indoor Games\n* Virtual Game Zone\n* Multipurpose Play Court\n* Carrom\n* Tri Cycle Track\n\n* Wellness Club\n* Community Club\n* Recreation/Kids Club\n* Swimming Pool\n* Play Area With Swimming Pool\n* Indoor Kids' Play Area\n* Indoor Games And Activities\n* Vaastu-Compliant Designs\n* Gym\n* Nature Walkway\n* Green Wall\n\n* Mo Sewage Treatment Plant\n* Organic Waste Convertor\n* Eco Life\n* Drip Irrigation System\n\n* 